@page "/live"
<main class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">M23 · LIVE TRADING BOUNDARY</p>
    <h1>Risk-gated semi-live and direct entry</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Turn verified paper evidence into a current broker proposal, then either place it manually or deliberately enable the protected direct route.</p>
    <section class="status-grid">
        <article><span class="card-index">01</span><h2>Semi-live</h2><p>Refreshes Zerodha funds, positions and depth, applies M18, and preserves a proposal without sending an order.</p></article>
        <article><span class="card-index">02</span><h2>Direct</h2><p>Requires the shared kill switch to be released, two disabled-by-default gates, explicit operator approval and an exact per-command confirmation.</p></article>
        <article><span class="card-index">03</span><h2>Fail closed</h2><p>Stale broker data, any open position, weak paper evidence, price drift or an uncertain submission stops automatic progress.</p></article>
    </section>
    <section class="boundary-banner">
        <div><span class="status-dot"></span><strong>Entry route only</strong></div>
        <p>M23 submits at most one MIS LIMIT buy and does not claim the position is filled. Exit automation and broker reconciliation must be completed before unattended trading.</p>
    </section>
</main>
